HCLOAD ~b~HELICOVER~w~: support inbound.
HCFOLL ~g~HELICOVER~w~: following CJ.
HCHOLD ~b~HELICOVER~w~: holding position.
HCDEPT ~b~HELICOVER~w~: departing.
HCFAIL ~r~HELICOVER~w~: model load failed. Try again.
HCOUT ~y~HELICOVER~w~: move outdoors to call support.
HCRWAIT ~y~EVAC~w~: unable to reach a safe hover. Move to open ground and retry.
HCGCLMB ~y~EVAC~w~: cannot climb safely. Clear obstacles and retry.
HCMAPOF ~y~EVAC~w~: map marker flight is disabled: it crashes CLEO Android.
HCDBG DBG ~1~
HCNEED ~y~HELICOVER~w~: call support first (HELICOVER > CALL SUPPORT).
HCNOMAP ~y~EVAC~w~: place a destination marker on the map first.
HCCHOS ~g~EVAC~w~: above destination. Press the exit button to get out.
HCAIR ~r~AIR THREAT!~w~ Returning fire on the police chopper.
HCCONT ~r~CONTACT!~w~ Door gunners engaging.
HCKILL ~g~TARGET DOWN~w~ - kills: ~1~
HCCLEAR ~g~AREA CLEAR.~w~ Gunners holding.
HCFM0 ~y~CEASE FIRE~w~: gunners stand down.
HCFM1 ~r~WEAPONS FREE~w~: engage everything except the team.
HCFM2 ~b~FOLLOW YOUR LEAD~w~: gunners fire on your targets.
HCFM3 ~g~PROTECT CJ~w~: engaging threats to CJ.
HCFM4 ~p~OVERWATCH~w~: precision fire on armed hostiles.
HCXROPE ~y~EVAC~w~: no clear landing spot here - using the rope.
HCNOPAD ~y~EVAC~w~: no flat landing spot - hovering for a rope exit.
HCXHERE ~g~EVAC~w~: getting out here. Finding a clear spot below.
HCXARR ~g~EVAC~w~: you will get out on arrival.
HCXWAIT ~y~EVAC~w~: wait until the helicopter lands or hovers.
HCDWAIT ~y~EVAC~w~: wait until the helicopter reaches the destination.
HCPAT ~b~HELICOVER~w~: patrolling around CJ.
HCAVOID ~y~HELICOVER~w~: path blocked; holding for a clear route.
HCROPE ~b~EVAC~w~: helicopter approaching for rope pickup.
HCEVAC ~b~EVAC~w~: landing nearby. Choose open, level ground.
HCTEAM ~g~EVAC~w~: flank team deployed. Use BOARD CJ when close.
HCBOARD ~g~EVAC~w~: CJ aboard. GROVE STREET recalls the team, then takes off.
HCGROVE ~g~EVAC~w~: team aboard. Heading to the Grove Street circle.
HCHOME ~b~EVAC~w~: approaching Grove Street.
HCARRIV ~g~EVAC~w~: landed. LEAVE HELICOPTER lets CJ out.
HCDAMAG ~r~HELICOVER~w~: critical damage. Retreating.
HCMUST ~b~EVAC~w~: team returning. Departure waits for living guards.
HCEMERG ~r~EVAC~w~: critical damage. Attempting a nearby emergency landing.
HCNOSEA ~y~EVAC~w~: Hunter has no passenger seat. Use Maverick or Police Maverick.
HCNOSIT ~y~EVAC~w~: landing site is obstructed or uneven. Move to open ground and retry.
HCFAR ~y~EVAC~w~: get within 12 metres of the landed helicopter.
HCWAIT ~y~EVAC~w~: waiting for the flank team. Clear their path or repeat the command.
HCIN ~y~EVAC~w~: CJ must be sitting in the helicopter before flying to Grove Street.
HCOFF ~r~HELICOVER~w~: copy all script files, then restart the game.
HCTAP ~b~HELICOVER~w~: release, then tap the exact screen centre to open the panel.
HCSWAP ~b~HELICOVER~w~: helicopter changed. Crew and CJ transferred.
HCSNO ~y~HELICOVER~w~: Hunter has no passenger seat. CJ must leave first.
HCSFAIL ~r~HELICOVER~w~: change failed; the current helicopter was kept.
HCCREW ~g~HELICOVER~w~: crew changed in place.
HCCFAIL ~r~HELICOVER~w~: crew change failed. Existing crew kept.
HCBLOCK ~y~EVAC~w~: landing unavailable. Clear the area and retry or choose FOLLOW CJ.
HCLOSE ~y~EVAC~w~: land first before boarding or leaving.
HCEXIT ~y~EVAC~w~: exit the helicopter before TAKE OFF / FOLLOW.
SQALR ~y~SQUAD~w~: the team is already on the ground.
SQNONE ~y~SQUAD~w~: no team on the ground.
SQFOOT ~y~SQUAD~w~: CJ must be on foot to receive the team.
SQCREW ~y~SQUAD~w~: wait until the crew is back aboard.
HCFOCUS ~r~SHOOTER ON CJ!~w~ Gunners focusing fire on him.
HCEVADE ~r~HELICOVER~w~: taking fire - evasive manoeuvre.
HCSHOT ~r~HELICOVER~w~: rounds on the helicopter - breaking away.
RGDEP SWAT: descending. Stay near the helicopter.
RGDONE SWAT: ground team withdrawn.
RGFAIL SWAT: model unavailable or heli moving.
RGHOLD SWAT: use HOLD POSITION first.
RGHIGH SWAT: heli must hover 12-22m above ground.
RGMOVE SWAT: wait until the helicopter is nearly still.
RGBLOCK SWAT: choose a clear open area.
RGUP EVAC: ascending.
RGABO EVAC: aboard. Team returning.
RGSEAT EVAC: passenger seat unavailable.
RGANIM EVAC: animation unavailable.
RPDFAIL EVAC: rope descent unavailable here.
SQIN ~g~SQUAD~w~: team on the ground. Escorting CJ.
SQBACK ~g~SQUAD~w~: team back aboard.
SQLOST ~r~SQUAD~w~: escort team lost.
SQCOVER ~g~SQUAD~w~: team covering your extraction.
SQXF ~r~SHOTS AT CJ - FRONT!~w~ Covering CJ, returning fire.
SQSF ~r~SNIPER - FRONT!~w~ Keep CJ behind cover!
SQVF ~r~CAR INCOMING - FRONT!~w~ Taking out the driver.
SQRF ~r~SHOOTER ON THE ROOF - FRONT!~w~ Engaging high.
SQXL ~r~SHOTS AT CJ - LEFT!~w~ Covering CJ, returning fire.
SQSL ~r~SNIPER - LEFT!~w~ Keep CJ behind cover!
SQVL ~r~CAR INCOMING - LEFT!~w~ Taking out the driver.
SQRL ~r~SHOOTER ON THE ROOF - LEFT!~w~ Engaging high.
SQXB ~r~SHOTS AT CJ - REAR!~w~ Covering CJ, returning fire.
SQSB ~r~SNIPER - REAR!~w~ Keep CJ behind cover!
SQVB ~r~CAR INCOMING - REAR!~w~ Taking out the driver.
SQRB ~r~SHOOTER ON THE ROOF - REAR!~w~ Engaging high.
SQXR ~r~SHOTS AT CJ - RIGHT!~w~ Covering CJ, returning fire.
SQSR ~r~SNIPER - RIGHT!~w~ Keep CJ behind cover!
SQVR ~r~CAR INCOMING - RIGHT!~w~ Taking out the driver.
SQRR ~r~SHOOTER ON THE ROOF - RIGHT!~w~ Engaging high.
SQCF ~r~CONTACT FRONT!~w~ Squad engaging.
SQCL ~r~CONTACT LEFT!~w~ Squad engaging.
SQCR ~r~CONTACT RIGHT!~w~ Squad engaging.
SQCB ~r~CONTACT REAR!~w~ Squad engaging.
SQAF ~r~CONTACT FRONT!~w~ Assault: bounding forward, flankers moving.
SQAL ~r~CONTACT LEFT!~w~ Assault: bounding forward, flankers moving.
SQAR ~r~CONTACT RIGHT!~w~ Assault: bounding forward, flankers moving.
SQAB ~r~CONTACT REAR!~w~ Assault: bounding forward, flankers moving.
SQCLR ~g~AREA SECURE.~w~ Squad regrouping on CJ.
SQDOWN ~r~MAN DOWN!~w~ We lost one of ours.
SQCOV ~r~CJ IS HIT!~w~ Shields up - covering CJ.
SQMED ~g~MEDIC~w~: CJ patched up.
SQMEDG ~g~MEDIC~w~: wounded teammate patched up.
SQCAR ~b~SQUAD~w~: mounting up with CJ.
SQRLD ~y~SQUAD~w~: reloading - cover me!
SQCVR ~y~SQUAD~w~: taking cover, returning fire.
SQEVAC ~r~SQUAD~w~: too hot here, CJ is hurt - EVAC recommended!
